  "pillar_roles_notes": {
    "P1_P2_P3": "Patient Outcomes, Operational Efficiency, and Provider Satisfaction have no clean match in the shared vocabulary (revenue/reliability/capacity/partner/expansion/adoption/engagement/compliance) -- this vertical has no partner or expansion pillar at all, by design (no channel/reseller motion, no commercial-expansion pillar). Left unmapped rather than force-fit onto 'reliability' or 'engagement'."
